, P1, P2, P3]}.\nBeliefs are your private probabilities of Mafia identity, not a public claim, and must sum to 1.\nTown players must assign zero to themselves; Mafia knows its own identity, so its own probability is 1.\nChoose your vote strategically. Return JSON only; no explanation or Markdown.", "accusation_likelihood_assumption": 0.5, "execution": {"python": "3.10.8", "platform": "Windows-10-10.0.26200-SP0", "timeout": 180, "max_calls": 200}}
